\[
\Delta{t = 3 \text{ years} \times \frac 1{1 - \frac{.6c}{2c}}} = 3 \times \frac{1}{1 - 0.3} = 3 \times \frac{1}{0.7} = 3.333 \text{ years}
\]  
The time elapsed on Earth is \(\boxed{3.333 \text{ years}}\).
